{"id":"f3992ad434a4dd9a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-prop-doob-decomposition.md","title":"Discrete Doob Decomposition","display":"prop-doob-decomposition — Discrete Doob Decomposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-doob-decomposition","aliases":["58-prop-doob-decomposition"],"display":"prop-doob-decomposition — Discrete Doob Decomposition","depends_on":["[[58-df-martingale]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-doob-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-doob-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-doob-decomposition — Discrete Doob Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"58-df-martingale\">58-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97097770861ae3fa\" href=\"?note=97097770861ae3fa\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,X,M,A,M&#39;,A&#39;\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,X,M,A,M&#39;,A&#39;\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（概率空间谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（次鞅谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97097770861ae3fa\" href=\"?note=97097770861ae3fa\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（鞅谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"58-df-martingale\">58-df-martingale</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span>（完全参数化的条件期望谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqAE}_S,\\mathrm{LeAE}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{EqAE}_S,\\mathrm{LeAE}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本原子定义的几乎处处相等与几乎处处次序谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（本原子定义的 Doob 分解候选谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(Y,Z,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y,Z\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)\\ne Z(\\xi)\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)\\ne Z(\\xi)\\})=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(Y,Z,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y,Z\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)\\ne Z(\\xi)\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)\\ne Z(\\xi)\\})=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LeAE}_S(Y,Z,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y,Z\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)&gt;Z(\\xi)\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)&gt;Z(\\xi)\\})=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ae\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LeAE}_S(Y,Z,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land Y,Z\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)&gt;Z(\\xi)\\}\\in\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid Y(\\xi)&gt;Z(\\xi)\\})=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}doob\\text{-}decomposition\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S(M,A,X,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\n\\land A\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;A_0(\\xi)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(A_{n+1}-A_n,X_{n+1}-X_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\mathrm{LeAE}_S(A_n,A_{n+1},\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(X_n,M_n+A_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}doob\\text{-}decomposition\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S(M,A,X,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\n\\land A\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^\\omega\n\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;A_0(\\xi)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\n(A_{n+1}-A_n,X_{n+1}-X_n,\\mathcal F_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\mathrm{LeAE}_S(A_n,A_{n+1},\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(X_n,M_n+A_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}doob\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\n(X,\\mathcal F,\\omega,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists M,A\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S(M,A,X,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall M&#39;,A&#39;\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S(M&#39;,A&#39;,X,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\n\\to\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(M&#39;_n,M_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(A&#39;_n,A_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}doob\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcProb2Submartingale}_S\n(X,\\mathcal F,\\omega,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists M,A\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S(M,A,X,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall M&#39;,A&#39;\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DoobPair}_S(M&#39;,A&#39;,X,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal A)\n\\to\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(M&#39;_n,M_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqAE}_S(A&#39;_n,A_n,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的增量在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n\">\\(\\mathcal F_n\\)</span> 可测，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始的离散时间可预测递增过程。</li>\n<li>唯一性在断言中显式按随机变量的几乎处处等价类表达，而不是使用普通的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\">\\(\\exists!\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对一般适应可积过程仍有 Doob 分解，但可预测部分不必递增；递增性来自次鞅假设。</li>\n<li>旧稿把未定义的三元条件期望及几乎处处符号当作原语，并误连到定义可测基数的文档；现已把它们全部展开为带概率空间参数的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md","status":"resolved","id":"97097770861ae3fa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-prob2-submartingale.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","em